 * maintenance language, which turns out to be a pest document in disguise:
 * a 584-home neighbourhood under an enforced "no weeds or dirt" standard, an
 * alley-to-curb responsibility rule, and a standing board complaint about
 * over-watering runoff. In a city that averages well under fifteen inches of
 * rain, an enforced landscape standard means irrigation, and irrigation is the
 * moisture anomaly that drives nearly everything we get called about.
 *
 * VERIFIED facts used here:
 *  - Platting, from the City of Odessa's own Plats feature service (surveyor
 *    initials, legal date, cabinet/page, acreage per filing):
 *      · 1983-05-19 road dedication plat, Faudree Rd & Dorado Dr, 37.037 ac
 *      · 1983-05-20 2nd Filing, 50.098 ac · 7th Filing same day, 17.225 ac
 *      · 1984-04-27 4th Filing corrected, 28.449 ac
 *      · 1985 corrected replats of the 2nd, 4th and 6th Filings
 *      · 1998-06-01 5th Filing replat, 25.374 ac
 *      · 2001-06-18 10th Filing (replat of the 8th), 17.732 ac
 *      · 2008-02-15 12th Filing, 1.000 ac · 2008-03-28 11th Filing, 52.873 ac
 *      · 2011 corrected replat of the 11th · 2023-03-08 13th Filing
