 *    initials, not full names — do not expand them into names.
 *  - Grouped subdivision record: "Mission Estates Addition", ACREAGE 296.80,
 *    inside city limits.
 *  - Mission Estates Property Owners' Association, PO Box 69263, Odessa
 *    79769. Its own pages state "584 homes in Mission" and that the
 *    association "has grown to almost 600 homes over the last several years";
