 *    Court, Cristobal, Mission Drive, San Gabriel, Dorado Drive, Faudree Road.
 *    Board records a four-way stop at Cristobal, one planned at San Jose and
 *    Augustine, and a "Your Speed Is" sign in place of striping.
 *  - Alleys AND curbs both exist — established by the association's own
 *    maintenance rule and its runoff complaint, not assumed from layout.
 *  - Ector County IS on the imported fire ant regulated-areas list under
 *    7 C.F.R. §301.81-3, adopted at 4 TAC §19.101. Read off the APHIS list.
 *
 * NOT ESTABLISHED — MUST NOT BE STATED:
 *  - COUNTY. The city's own attribute table puts Mission Estates in MIDLAND
 *    County on 20 of 21 plat records, which cannot be right for a subdivision
 *    inside Odessa. It is a data-entry problem in the source, not a finding.
 *    This page says Odessa and Ector County because that is where Odessa is,
 *    and makes no claim off the plat attribute.
 *  - GOLF COURSE ADJACENCY. The Club at Mission Dorado exists nearby and the
 *    Mission Dorado plats interleave with these along the northern edge, but
 *    the club is unplatted acreage and the boundary was never confirmed. The
 *    page frames irrigated turf CONDITIONALLY — "if you back onto it" — and
 *    never asserts that the subdivision adjoins a course.
 *  - RENTAL CHARACTER. An earlier draft of neighborhoods.ts described this as
 *    an area "with real rental turnover" and led on bed bugs. No source
 *    supports that at neighbourhood level; the city-wide 2020 rental vacancy
 *    figure is a CITY statistic and does not describe a 584-home covenanted
 *    subdivision. Claim removed from the data file, not just from the page.
 *  - Lot counts per filing. Odessa's Plats layer has a "Lots" field whose
 *    alias is "Lots Complete" and whose domain is Yes/No. It is NOT a count.
 *  - Floodplain, drainage or playa mapping. Odessa publishes no public
 *    floodplain or playa layer. Unlike Midland, there is nothing to read.
 *  - School attendance zones. No retrievable ECISD boundary source.
 *  - Developer name. Only surveyor initials are recorded.
 */
